    <string name="anim_progress_title">Filled LEDs + next LED</string>
    <string name="anim_progress_desc" formatted="false">Completed LEDs stay on. Only the next LED animates and advances with the actual battery level. With one zone: at 50% of 20 LEDs, 10 stay on and LED 11 animates. Across all zones, 50% means 18 of 36 LEDs stay on and LED 19 animates; the selected direction is respected. At 0% all are off; at 100% all are steady unless the charge-limit action takes priority. Wave, Hourglass and Smooth Fill use brightness on the next LED instead of moving across the filled part.</string>
